From: Prospero Win contributors <prospero-win@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: opt in to shared event/semaphore operations

Depends on 0885/0886. Add an independent versioned native ABI, exact handle
and permission cache, and single-CAS operations for eligible events and
semaphores. Preserve the mutex ABI and strict independent default-off
selection. Existing close invalidations clear both caches. Alertable and
multi-object waits, pulse/query and SignalObjectAndWait remain ordinary.

Console semantic and performance gates remain required.

